<section class="founding-teaser" aria-label="Founding Membership"><p class="eyebrow">Founding Membership</p><h2>The main way to get the full library.</h2><p>Full carousels, the full UI/UX Prompt Packet, and one reviewed feature. ${foundingPass.priceUSD} USD once for the first {foundingPass.introductoryLimit} members. Not a subscription. A feature is never guaranteed. The packet and the promotional spot are still available on their own.</p><a class="button" href={foundingPass.checkoutUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Get Founding Membership</a><p class="quiet"><a href="/founding-members">Member sign-in and what is included</a></p></section>
